{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1226995-quotes-you-can-build-a-character-off-of","id":1226995,"title":"Quotes you can build a character off of","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-12T18:34:32-07:00","id":1226995,"title":"Quotes you can build a character off of","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">You know those quotes that are just so awesome that you can't help but think &quot;I want to say that&quot; those quotes that you just think &quot;wow&quot; well, why not make a character based on those? You can either quote something else, or make up something new, or somewhere in between.<br /> <br /> Go nuts.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-12T18:55:54-07:00","id":1227007,"title":"","content":"\u201cBuild \u2018em up, break \u2018em down.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cArmor\u2019s up!\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you build it... they will die.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cLet\u2019s hear those guns!\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOops! Did I leave that there?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDo you hear me, baby? Hold together!\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m giving it all she\u2019s got!\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T06:27:07-07:00","id":1227128,"title":"","content":"&quot;We both have blood on our hands. The difference between you and I, however, is whether we can wash it off and forget it. Can you?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I thought you were an actual mountain. I'd apologize for trying to mine you, but we seem beyond that point. Let's rumble.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I only slept with her sister because it was my duty. Stop laughing.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The end of Creation may very well mean the beginning of something else. Let's not see what that might be just yet.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Destiny is a lie. I wasn't born for this; I was chosen.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;How many bodies do we have to stack up before the enemy gets the picture?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;When I began this journey, I was a wanderer. Then, I found enlightenment. Now, I wander again.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;It's not stealing if they're already dead! Fill your pockets and let's get out of here!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T06:31:21-07:00","id":1227130,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>I made this half-pony, half-monkey monster to please you, but I get the feeling that you don't like it, what's with all the screaming? You like monkeys, you like ponies. Maybe you don't like monsters so much? Maybe I used too many monkeys ... isn't it enough to know that I ruined a pony making a gift for you?</i>&quot; - Jonathan Coulton (Skullcrusher Mountain)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Ring the bells that still can ring. Forget your perfect offering. There is a crack ... a crack in everything. That's how the light gets in.</i>&quot; - Leonard Cohen (Anthem)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Act with wisdom, but act.</i>&quot; - Sylvari proverb, Guild Wars 2 <br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Didn't make sense not to live for fun. Your brain gets smart, but your head gets dumb.</i>&quot; - Smash Mouth (All Star)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>I'm a bitch, I'm a lover, I'm a child, I'm a mother, I'm a sinner, I'm a saint. I do not feel ashamed.</i>&quot; - Meredith Brooks (Bitch) - recommended for those with persona Charms. <br /> <br /> &quot;<i>What have I become, my sweetest friend? Everyone I know goes away in the end. You could have it all - my empire of dirt. I will let you down. I will make you hurt. If I could start again, a million miles away, I would keep myself. I would find a way.</i>&quot; - Nine Inch Nails (Hurt)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>It is far safer to be feared than loved.</i>&quot; - Niccol<span style=\"color:#382110\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\">\u00f2</span></span> </span></span>Machiavelli (The Prince)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Please allow me to introduce myself. I'm a man of wealth and taste. I've been around for a long, long year, stole many a man's soul to waste.</i>&quot; The Rolling Stones (Sympathy for the Devil)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>He's not the Messiah, he's a very naughty boy!</i>&quot; - Monty Python (Life of Brian)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>I get drunk on jealousy, but you'll come back each time you leave. 'Cause darling, I'm a nightmare dressed like a daydream.</i>&quot; - Taylor Swift (Blank Space)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>The weak can never forgive. Forgiveness is the attribute of the strong.</i>&quot; - Mahatma Ghandi<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>It's funny how some distance makes everything seem small. And the fears that once controlled me can't get to me at all. It's time to see what I can do, to test the limits and break through. No right, no wrong, no rules for me. I'm free.</i>&quot; - Idina Menzel (Let It Go)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Meticulous planning, tenacity spanning decades of denial is simply why I'll be king undisputed - respected, saluted, and seen for the wonder I am! Yes, my teeth and ambitions are bared, be prepared!</i>&quot; - Jeremy Irons (Be Prepared)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Out of the night that covers me, black as the pit from pole to pole, I thank whatever gods may be, for my unconquerable soul.</i>&quot; - William Ernest Henley (Invictus)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>And if you ask me how I'm feeling, don't tell me you're too blind to see. Never gonna give you up, never gonna let you down, never gonna run around and desert you.</i>&quot; - Rick Astley (Never Gonna Give You Up)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Measure of Hope is right about everything.&quot; - Wise Old Guru<br /> <br /> Currently running an Exalted 2.5 Abyssals game in a homebrew modern shard because I value neither my time or my sanity, and I'm loving almost every minute of it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23907-measure-of-hope","name":"Measure of Hope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T08:26:36-07:00","id":1227144,"title":"","content":"&quot;Today we <b><i>cancel </i></b>the apocalypse!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T08:43:59-07:00","id":1227146,"title":"","content":"&quot;Never have only one reason for doing something.&quot; - paraphrased from Elvenbane, Lord Dyran I think<br /> <br /> &quot;I believe that bear is wearing people clothes.&quot; - Josh Faraday, The Magnificent Seven<br /> <br /> &quot;What we lost in the fire, we found in the ashes.&quot; - Sam Chisolm, The Magnificent Seven","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24219-goddessgood","name":"goddessgood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24219_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T08:55:47-07:00","id":1227154,"title":"","content":"&quot;I made a promise by the side of the road/that I would bury my goddamned halo&quot; - Burning Brides, <i>Heart Full of Black</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>DrLoveMonkey - &quot;On the other hand having a warhammer that's basically a steel beer keg on the end of a seven foot pole is fucking awesome.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9453-octopoid","name":"Octopoid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"424"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T10:45:22-07:00","id":1227172,"title":"","content":"&quot;It is important that we establish an effective teacher-pupil relationship. If we had more time, we would build the foundations of the relationship on mutual respect and trust. As it is, it will be easier to work with fear and pain.&quot; - Lotus, <i>Sgt. Kabukiman N.Y.P.D.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T11:16:25-07:00","id":1227179,"title":"","content":"&quot;What is good in life you say? Why, to crush your enemies, drive them before you, and hear the lamentations of the chickas!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I have observed the wages of sin. They were quite high, for it seems that sin pays well these days. I will change that - and I will leave the sinners poor, owning but the patch of dirt they are buried in&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T16:46:33-07:00","id":1227270,"title":"","content":"Quotes, or song lyrics rather, I have built characters off of:<br /> <br /> Chosen of Serenity-<br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">&quot;There are things we can't recall, Blind as night that finds us all</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Winter tucks her children in, her fragile china dolls</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">But my hands remember hers, rolling around the shaded ferns</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Naked arms, her secrets still like songs I'd never learned&quot;</span></span><br /> ______<br /> <br /> Water Aspect -<br /> &quot;Hook me up a new revolution<br /> 'Cause this one is a lie<br /> We sat around laughing and watched the last one die&quot;<br /> <br /> ______<br /> <br /> Renegade Midnight-<br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">I will learn to love the skies I'm under</span></span>&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> _______<br /> <br /> Chosen of Endings - <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">&quot;Brave lady could you see me in the</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Darkness</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Wait, nameless like a stone&quot;<br /> <br /> ____________<br /> <br /> Alchemical-<br /> &quot;If only the clockworks could speak</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">I wouldn't be so alone</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">We burn every magnet and spring</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">And spiral into the unknown&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> ________<br /> <br /> Twilight-<br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">And so lying underneath those stormy skies</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">She'd say, &quot;Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">I know the sun must set to rise</span></span>&quot;<br /> <br /> ____________<br /> <br /> Chosen of Secrets- <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">I know I'll wither so peel away the bark</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">'Cause nothing grows when it is dark</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">In spite of all my fears, I can see it all so clear</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">I see it all so clear</span></span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 06-14-2018, 05:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T20:52:19-07:00","id":1227340,"title":"","content":"&quot;Weapons are a coward's weapon.&quot; -Sean Conneelly","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T00:13:59-07:00","id":1227378,"title":"","content":"&quot;Do you believe in destiny?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T06:37:58-07:00","id":1227425,"title":"","content":"&quot;Take my love, take my land, take me where I cannot stand,<br /> I don't care, I'm still free. You can't take the sky from me.&quot;<br /> -Firefly theme song","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>DrLoveMonkey - &quot;On the other hand having a warhammer that's basically a steel beer keg on the end of a seven foot pole is fucking awesome.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9453-octopoid","name":"Octopoid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"424"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T07:49:32-07:00","id":1227436,"title":"","content":"(Fiends)<br /> So prepare for the coup of the century.<br /> Be prepared for mirkiest scam.<br /> (SWLIHN)<br /> Meticulous planning<br /> (Adorjan)<br /> Tenacity spanning<br /> (Cecylene)<br /> Decades of Denial<br /> (Malfeas-as-Green Sun, with ED's voice as a faint whisper)<br /> is simply why I'll<br /> be King, Undisputed, Respected, Saluted<br /> (ED Alone, bofuscating green sun with open-fanged roar)<br /> And Seen for the Wonder I Am!<br /> Yes my teeth and ambitions are bared.<br /> (Full Infernal Chorus)<br /> Be Prepared!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T08:11:20-07:00","id":1227442,"title":"","content":"More seriously, perhaps, I used to like 'Death is lighter than a feather; duty is heavier than a mountain.'<br /> I cn't seem to recall where that came from. I think it's a Wheel of Time quote? The nature of taa'veren and reincarnating, doomed heroes does have its appeal here...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T10:11:10-07:00","id":1227462,"title":"","content":"One that actually inspired me to a charactr just now<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm not a god! I'm a security officer.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1920-kim","name":"Kim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T12:41:22-07:00","id":1227496,"title":"","content":"I'm gonna cheat, I'm offering up Discworld quotes.<br /> It's cheating because they're very evocative, or coming from very evocative characters in the first place (like Vetinari or Granny Weatherwax). Damn, even with wildly different metaphysics and cosmology, there's a surprising amount that can apply as-is to Exalted...<br /> <br /> - &quot;If complete and utter chaos was lightning, then he'd be the sort to stand on a hilltop in a thunderstorm wearing wet copper armour and shouting 'All gods are bastards'.&quot;<br /> - &quot;Early to rise, early to bed, makes a man healthy, wealthy, and dead.&quot;<br /> - &quot;She told me if magic gives people what they want, then not using magic can give them what they need.&quot;<br /> - &quot;I USHERED SOULS INTO THE NEXT WORLD. I WAS THE GRAVE OF ALL HOPE. I WAS THE ULTIMATE REALITY. I WAS THE ASSASSIN AGAINST WHOM NO LOCK WOULD HOLD.<br /> \u201dYes, point taken, but do you have any particular skills?\u201d<br /> - &quot;It's vital to remember who you really are. It's very important. It isn't a good idea to rely on other people or things to do it for you, you see. They always get it wrong.&quot;<br /> - &quot;Suddenly life wasn't worth living. The fact that he wasn't living it didn't cheer him up at all.&quot;<br /> - &quot;He\u2019d wanted changes. It was just that he wanted things to stay the same, as well.&quot;<br /> - &quot;I believe you find life such a problem because you think there are good people and bad people. You're wrong, of course. There are, always and only, the bad people, but some of them are on opposite sides.&quot;<br /> - &quot;His age was indeterminate. But in cynicism and general world weariness, which is a sort of carbon dating of the personality, he was about seven thousand years old.&quot;<br /> - &quot;Demons have existed [in the world] for at least as long as the gods, who in many ways they closely resemble. The difference is basically the same as that between terrorists and freedom fighters.&quot;<br /> - &quot;Was that justice? Was that a proper reward for being a firm believer in reincarnation for almost 130 years? You come back as a corpse?<br /> No wonder the undead were traditionally considered to be very angry.&quot;<br /> - &quot;What\u2019s the good of having mastery over cosmic balance and knowing the secrets of fate if you can\u2019t blow something up?&quot;<br /> - \u201cListen, happy endings is fine if they turn out happy,\u201d said Granny, glaring at the sky. \u201cBut you can\u2019t make \u2019em for other people. Like the only way you could make a happy marriage is by cuttin\u2019 their heads off as soon as they say \u2018I do\u2019, yes? You can\u2019t make happiness...\u201d Granny Weatherwax stared at the distant city. \u201cAll you can do,\u201d she said, \u201cis make an ending.\u201d<br /> - &quot;\u201cThat\u2019s why it\u2019s always worth having a few philosophers around the place. One minute it\u2019s all Is Truth Beauty and Is Beauty Truth, and Does A Falling Tree in the Forest Make A Sound if There\u2019s No one There to Hear It, and then just when you think they\u2019re going to start dribbling one of \u2019em says, Incidentally, putting a thirty-foot parabolic reflector on a high place to shoot the rays of the sun at an enemy\u2019s ships would be a very interesting demonstration of optical principles.&quot;<br /> - &quot;He thought: the worst thing about Vorbis isn\u2019t that he\u2019s evil, but that he makes good people do evil. He turns people into things like himself.&quot;<br /> - &quot;No. No smiting. No commandments unless you obey them too.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T14:47:53-07:00","id":1227527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Khan Noonien Singh</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">You, you can't even break a rule, how would you be expected to <i>break bone</i>?</div> </div> </div> </div>I loved this line as soon as I heard it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/415-equitable-remedy","name":"Equitable Remedy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar415_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T21:58:11-07:00","id":1227593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brasstreader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1226995-quotes-you-can-build-a-character-off-of?p=1227442#post1227442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More seriously, perhaps, I used to like 'Death is lighter than a feather; duty is heavier than a mountain.'<br /> I cn't seem to recall where that came from. I think it's a Wheel of Time quote? The nature of taa'veren and reincarnating, doomed heroes does have its appeal here...</div> </div> </div> </div>That quote recurs regularly throughout WoT. The first time is when Lan is teaching Rand about life, soldiering, swordsmanship, being a man, what have you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11847-kfinigan","name":"KFinigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T01:45:22-07:00","id":1227607,"title":"","content":"There's one exchange I'm always going to recall from a Werewolf: the Forsaken game my friend was running. We'd come across a woman who was turning to Skinchanging out of an interest in joining Werewolf society. My character, a reasonably high Harmony Blood Talon, highjacked the woman and took her out to an isolated island, planning to kill her for the sake of keeping knowledge of the Uratha out of human hands. This confused my storyteller, who was unclear of my intentions, prompting the following exchange. <br /> <br /> &quot;I don't get it... Are you doing a Rite?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;No. I'm doing a wrong.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11867-caffeine-delusions","name":"Caffeine Delusions","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11867_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T05:33:48-07:00","id":1227626,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brasstreader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1226995-quotes-you-can-build-a-character-off-of?p=1227442#post1227442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More seriously, perhaps, I used to like 'Death is lighter than a feather; duty is heavier than a mountain.'<br /> I cn't seem to recall where that came from. I think it's a Wheel of Time quote? The nature of taa'veren and reincarnating, doomed heroes does have its appeal here...</div> </div> </div> </div>It's also used in Legend of the Five Rings, I believe; talking about the samurai's life of duty. It's a great quote.<br /> <br /> For me there is: &quot;Life before death; strength before weakness; journey before destination.&quot; and a whole host of other good quotes from the Ideals of the Knights Radiant in Sanderson's Stormlight Archive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12111-the_larz","name":"the_larz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T06:30:04-07:00","id":1227633,"title":"","content":"&quot;Death is always true. You haven't known a true thing in all your life. You think you know death, but you don't. You didn't recognize him sitting across from you this whole time.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T09:08:53-07:00","id":1227682,"title":"","content":"&quot;You! If I step on you, will you die?&quot;<br /> &quot;... yes?&quot;<br /> &quot;Ah! At last, back in the mortal realm!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T09:28:52-07:00","id":1227686,"title":"","content":"And another Discworld bonus, catching up to where I'm at. So many more books left.<br /> <br /> - \u201cYou\u2019ve come to wage war on Omnia. This would not be a good idea.\u201d<br /> \u201cFrom Omnia\u2019s point of view, yes.\u201d<br /> \u201cFrom everyone\u2019s. You will probably defeat us. But not all of us. And then what will you do? Leave a garrison? Forever? And eventually a new generation will retaliate. Why you did this won\u2019t mean anything to them. You\u2019ll be the oppressors. They\u2019ll fight. They might even win. And there\u2019ll be another war. And one day people will say: why didn\u2019t they sort it all out, back then? On the beach. Before it all started. Before all those people died. Now we have that chance. Aren\u2019t we lucky?&quot;<br /> - \u201cI like the idea of democracy. You have to have someone everyone distrusts,\u201d said Brutha. \u201cThat way, everyone\u2019s happy.\u201d<br /> - A man can be defined by the things he hates. There were quite a lot of things that Captain Vimes hated. Assassins were near the top of the list, just after kings and the undead. <br /> - Sometimes it\u2019s better to light a flamethrower than curse the darkness.<br /> - If you have to look along the shaft of an arrow from the wrong end, if a man has you entirely at his mercy, then hope like hell that man is an evil man. Because the evil like power, power over people, and they want to see you in fear. They want you to know you\u2019re going to die. So they\u2019ll talk. They\u2019ll gloat. They\u2019ll watch you squirm. They\u2019ll put off the murder like another man will put off a good cigar. So hope like hell your captor is an evil man. A good man will kill you with hardly a word.<br /> - Today is a good day for someone else to die!<br /> - \u201cDid you really punch the president of the Assassins\u2019 Guild?\u201d<br /> \u201cYes, sir.\u201d<br /> \u201cWhy?\u201d<br /> \u201cDidn\u2019t have a dagger, sir.\u201d<br /> - &quot;She says she is five years old.&quot; \u201cIn years, yes. In cynicism, she\u2019s about thirty-five.\u201d<br /> - Anyway, then later on it sinks to the level of religion and then they start this business where some poor bugger finds a special bean in his tucker, oho, everyone say, you\u2019re king, mate, and he thinks \u201cThis is a bit of all right\u201d only they don\u2019t say it wouldn\u2019t be a good idea to start any long books, \u2019cos next thing he\u2019s legging it over the snow with a dozen other buggers chasing him with holy sickles so\u2019s the earth\u2019ll come to life again and all this snow\u2019ll go away. Very, you know...ethnic. Then some bright spark thought, hey, looks like that damn sun comes up anyway, so how come we\u2019re giving those druids all this free grub? Next thing you know, there\u2019s a job vacancy. That\u2019s the thing about gods. They\u2019ll always find a way to, you know...hang on.\u201d<br /> - \u201cShe wasn\u2019t necessary,\u201d said Teatime. \u201cFew people are.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T09:38:35-07:00","id":1227690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Octopoid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1226995-quotes-you-can-build-a-character-off-of?p=1227425#post1227425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Take my love, take my land, take me where I cannot stand,<br /> I don't care, I'm still free. You can't take the sky from me.&quot;<br /> -Firefly theme song</div> </div> </div> </div>I thinking about this thread at work yesterday and started humming that song. It really is very character-defining. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brasstreader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1226995-quotes-you-can-build-a-character-off-of?p=1227442#post1227442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More seriously, perhaps, I used to like 'Death is lighter than a feather; duty is heavier than a mountain.'<br /> I cn't seem to recall where that came from. I think it's a Wheel of Time quote? The nature of taa'veren and reincarnating, doomed heroes does have its appeal here...</div> </div> </div> </div>Lan said that a lot, I think it was a Malkieri proverb. It's been a while since I read the books. <br /> <br /> N<span style=\"font-size:12px\">ow try to guess which movie I have on the brain. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\">&quot;<span style=\"color:#333333\"><i>You see, their morals, their code, it's a bad joke. Dropped at the first sign of trouble. They're only as good as the world allows them to be. I'll show you. When the chips are down, these... these civilized people, they'll eat each other. See, I'm not a monster. I'm just ahead of the curve.</i>&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;<i>You either die a hero or you live long enough to see yourself become the villain.</i>&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><i>You thought we could be decent men in an indecent time. But you were wrong. The world is cruel, and the only morality in a cruel world is chance. Unbiased. Unprejudiced. Fair.</i>&quot;</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Measure of Hope is right about everything.&quot; - Wise Old Guru<br /> <br /> Currently running an Exalted 2.5 Abyssals game in a homebrew modern shard because I value neither my time or my sanity, and I'm loving almost every minute of it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23907-measure-of-hope","name":"Measure of Hope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T11:33:17-07:00","id":1227705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Measure of Hope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1226995-quotes-you-can-build-a-character-off-of?p=1227690#post1227690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> N<span style=\"font-size:12px\">ow try to guess which movie I have on the brain.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\">&quot;<span style=\"color:#333333\"><i>You see, their morals, their code, it's a bad joke. Dropped at the first sign of trouble. They're only as good as the world allows them to be. I'll show you. When the chips are down, these... these civilized people, they'll eat each other. See, I'm not a monster. I'm just ahead of the curve.</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>You either die a hero or you live long enough to see yourself become the villain.</i>&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><i>You thought we could be decent men in an indecent time. But you were wrong. The world is cruel, and the only morality in a cruel world is chance. Unbiased. Unprejudiced. Fair.</i>&quot;</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>The first quote is obviously Heath Ledgers take on the Joker,<br /> And the other two quotes is Two Face/Harvey Dent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T11:38:07-07:00","id":1227706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Measure of Hope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1226995-quotes-you-can-build-a-character-off-of?p=1227690#post1227690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>You see, their morals, their code, it's a bad joke. Dropped at the first sign of trouble. They're only as good as the world allows them to be. I'll show you. When the chips are down, these... these civilized people, they'll eat each other. See, I'm not a monster. I'm just ahead of the curve.</i>&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>This quote is, literally, the basis for my Fiend/Scourge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>DrLoveMonkey - &quot;On the other hand having a warhammer that's basically a steel beer keg on the end of a seven foot pole is fucking awesome.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9453-octopoid","name":"Octopoid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"424"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T11:59:26-07:00","id":1227709,"title":"","content":"There's always an Arquillian Battle Cruiser, or a Corillian Death Ray, or an intergalactic plague that is about to wipe out all life on this miserable little planet, and the only way these people can get on with their happy lives is that they DO NOT KNOW ABOUT IT!<br /> K from Men in Black. <br /> <br /> Perfect for a Sidereal to my mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T12:49:22-07:00","id":1227727,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am your Grim Reaper. I can blow out the candle of your life at any time&quot;<br /> &quot;If I can't blow out your candle, I'll just chew it from top down.&quot;<br /> <br /> Tsurumi from Golden Kamuy might make a decent abyssal :P<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/357-plotvitalnpc","name":"PlotVitalNPC","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar357_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-15T18:17:55-07:00","id":1227793,"title":"","content":"From a song:<br /> <br /> &quot;Vengence from the grave<br /> Kills the people he once saved&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-17T02:11:57-07:00","id":1227986,"title":"","content":"&quot;Only one man has ever survived battle with my people. He stands behind me. You are in front of me. If you value your lives, be somewhere else!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We robots don't have emotions, and sometimes that makes me sad.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I'M THE AVATAR, AND YOU GOTTA DEAL WITH IT!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Second star to the right, and straight on till morning!&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-17T03:14:16-07:00","id":1227992,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm done wasting so much of my life on anger, on vengeance, on <i>you</i>. Screw you,&quot; he sheathes his Grand Daiklaive and turns away from his foe, &quot;I'm going back to my village. You were never worth the effort, maybe thats why the Wyld Hunt left you alone for so long.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;What I'm doing is foolish, these people are not worth the air and sustenance they require to live and are quite honestly not remarkable in any way save for their <i>astounding</i> mediocrity. And yet here I stand, ready to give my life to save their miserable lives. Ever hour I spent preparing for this battle I have ruminated on the cause of my actions and I have come to a single conclusion each time. These people are my <i>friends</i>, my <i>family</i>, and I care for their lives. And maybe thats foolish, maybe thats just me allowing my sentiments to win over logic, but I. <b>Don't</b>. <b><i>Care</i></b>. The only way you're going to harm them is through me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12398,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12398-darchon5","user":"DArchon5","date":". 06-17-2018, 06:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12398-darchon5","name":"DArchon5","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-17T05:41:16-07:00","id":1228010,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BjornTheFellhanded</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1226995-quotes-you-can-build-a-character-off-of?p=1227986#post1227986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Only one man has ever survived battle with my people. He stands behind me. You are in front of me. If you value your lives, be somewhere else!&quot;<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;No boom today. Boom tomorrow. Always boom tomorrow.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12111-the_larz","name":"the_larz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-17T09:45:50-07:00","id":1228058,"title":"","content":"&quot;I guess I'm just too tough to cry.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Just today you were crying about snakes.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;They don't have any arms!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-18T19:03:38-07:00","id":1228447,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm here to kick ass and chew bubblegum, and I'm all outta gum.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-18T21:16:40-07:00","id":1228494,"title":"","content":"Those that would speak convincingly of peace must be strong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like my Avatar? Courtesy of<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> Jen</span>! : <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Anybody want their characters to be experimented on ? </span>post 98<br /> <i>An Exalt is never unarmed.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4018-l-het-esh","name":"L'het'esh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-19T18:34:35-07:00","id":1228725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brasstreader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1226995-quotes-you-can-build-a-character-off-of?p=1227442#post1227442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More seriously, perhaps, I used to like 'Death is lighter than a feather; duty is heavier than a mountain.'<br /> I cn't seem to recall where that came from. I think it's a Wheel of Time quote? The nature of taa'veren and reincarnating, doomed heroes does have its appeal here...</div> </div> </div> </div>\u201cThe quote, \u201c<b>Death is lighter than a feather</b>, but <b>Duty is heavier than a mountain</b>\u201d is not original with Robert Jordan. It is from the 1882 Japanese Imperial Rescript to Soldiers and Sailors, which states that &quot;<b>duty is heavier than a mountain</b>; <b>death is lighter than a feather</b>.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24266-aoi-cobalt","name":"Aoi Cobalt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-19T21:28:25-07:00","id":1228759,"title":"","content":"&quot;I have dug my grave on this planet and I will either Triumph or I will Die&quot; -Chaplain Grimaldus of the Black Templar, Warhammer 40k. <br /> <br /> My old Circle had a Grimaldus ersatz character and he literally dug his own grave on the battlefield before several major battles. <br /> <br /> &quot;I will find a way, or I will make one&quot; Hannibal Barca of Carthage, on crossing the Alps. <br /> <br /> &quot;The special quality of Hell is to see everything clearly down to the last detail&quot; -Yukio Mishima<br /> <br /> &quot;Anything can become excusable when seen from the standpoint of the result&quot; -Mishima","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-19T23:57:34-07:00","id":1228790,"title":"","content":"&quot;Snakes. Why did it have to be snakes?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Do as thou wilt shall be the whole of the law.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't think that word means what you think it means.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11847-kfinigan","name":"KFinigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-20T02:07:48-07:00","id":1228804,"title":"","content":"\u201cSome people think they can outsmart me. Maybe... Maybe. I have yet to meet one who can outsmart <i><s>bullet</s> goremaul</i>.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-22T09:47:37-07:00","id":1229384,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;Damn their treaties, damn their kings. I've got a gun named destiny.&quot;</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1982-spacepup","name":"Spacepup","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-22T13:56:45-07:00","id":1229449,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m a sucker for Robert E. Howard quotes. Here\u2019s one for a Dawn caste:<br /> <br /> \u201cWhen I was a fighting-man, the kettle-drums they beat,<br /> The people scattered gold-dust before my horse's feet;<br /> But now I am a great king, the people hound my track<br /> With poison in my wine-cup, and daggers at my back.\u201d<br /> <br /> ...and one for a Lunar:<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat do I know of cultured ways, the gilt, the craft and the lie?<br /> I, who was born in a naked land and bred in the open sky.<br /> The subtle tongue, the sophist guile, they fail when the broadswords sing;<br /> Rush in and die, dogs\u2014I was a man before I was a king.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5397-cytherea","name":"Cytherea","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-22T22:50:46-07:00","id":1229523,"title":"","content":"Anything for the family.<br /> <br /> Always repay your debts.<br /> <br /> With great power comes great responsibility.<br /> <br /> This forest has eyes; and teeth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-23T06:12:53-07:00","id":1229576,"title":"","content":"\u201dUpon him I\u2019ll visit famine and a fire<br /> till all around him desolation rings<br /> and all the demons in the outer dark<br /> look on amazed and recognize<br /> that vengeance is the business of a man.\u201d<br /> - Patrick Rothfuss, The Name of the Wind","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 06-23-2018, 09:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T16:09:58-07:00","id":1230116,"title":"","content":"&quot;Thieves of all the world, having by their universal plunder exhausted the land, they rifle the deep. Where their enemy is rich, they are rapacious; if he be poor, they lust for dominion; neither the east nor the west has been able to satisfy them. Alone among men they covet with equal eagerness poverty and riches.<br /> <br /> To ruin, slaughter and plunder, they give the name of empire; and where they make a desert they call it peace.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T03:59:02-07:00","id":1230765,"title":"","content":"On the subject of Pat Rothfuss, one for the immortals and elder Celestials with an affection for humanity:<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>How odd to watch a mortal kindle<br /> Then to dwindle day by day.<br /> Knowing their bright souls are tinder<br /> And the wind will have its way.<br /> Would I could my own fire lend.<br /> What does your flickering portend?</i>&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Measure of Hope is right about everything.&quot; - Wise Old Guru<br /> <br /> Currently running an Exalted 2.5 Abyssals game in a homebrew modern shard because I value neither my time or my sanity, and I'm loving almost every minute of it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23907-measure-of-hope","name":"Measure of Hope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T09:22:56-07:00","id":1230835,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#1F1F1F\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">graceful / wicked / Masques \\ indeed<br /> <br /> &quot;I'd heard it said that fairies have no souls.&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1F1F1F\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;Then I do ache, and bleed, and smart elsewhere; still, c